  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.4-local.1 - Fixed: a POCO with no parameterless constructor (a positional record, a class with get-only properties set by its constructor) is read through its constructor, as System.Text.Json does; it read back as null through a worker before. v3.0.3 - Added the HTMLTextAreaElement wrapper (value, selection, SetRangeText, constraint validation). Fixed: GPUVertexFormat.UInt16x4 was named nt16x4 in C# (it always serialized correctly as uint16x4). Full history: CHANGELOG.md",
